	(text "A cleared global permit forces all seven commands LOW.\nA LOW request disables its own rail while other requested rails\nmay remain enabled. Matrix permission is separate and can be\nremoved while these auxiliary supplies remain powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.88 0)
