	)
	(text "Each used channel follows the same rule:\nCMD_x = GLOBAL_PWR_PERMIT AND EN_REQ_x.\nThe request selects a rail; the permit authorizes its operation.\nThe unused U2802 inputs are grounded and its output is not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
