	(text "This second AON-powered gate bank qualifies the auxiliary supply\nrequests for FPGA I/O, memory, PHY and analog circuitry in MIRA.\nTogether with the primary bank, it lets the power manager stage\nstartup and revoke all switched-rail enables through one permit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
